'''Green Elite''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Elite Gamepass]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]] in order to promote and convince players to buy it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is parsley green in color with a dark skull imprinted in the center. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia== 
*It is a variant of and partners with the legendary knives [[Elite]] and [[Blue Elite]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Elite Set|Elite Set]].

